  "summary": "This experiment tested an RNA-only model in a multiprofile setting using scvi_n200 encoder and avgpool aggregation, achieving validation accuracy of 0.6501 and F1 of 0.6275, higher than previous singleprofile baselines. The results suggest the multiprofile setting may contribute to improved performance, though the exact impact of this setting versus other factors remains uncertain due to limited comparative evidence."
